<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gallagher to tap market for 90 mln rand.</title>
<headline>Gallagher to tap market for 90 mln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African conference holder Gallagher Estate Holdings Ltd, formerly known as Riccia Property, said on Friday it plans to raise about 90 million rand with a rights issue.</p>
<p>The group said an announcement giving the terms of the renounceable rights offer of new ordinary shares would be made on October 14.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
